# {{projectName}}

React (Vite) single-page app scaffolded by InitPad.

- `npm install` then `npm run dev` — local dev server
- `npm run build` — static bundle into `dist/`

Dev/test run on Docker (nginx serving the build); prod is published as static
files over SFTP. `vite.config.js` uses `base: './'` so the app works under a
subpath.
